# sys-regi-ruins-dots (decomp ScrCmd_ActivateRegiRuinsDot). The Iron Ruins after the
# credits: each of the seven dots (coord events, once per visit) sets its bit in VAR_IRON_RUINS_STATE with the jump
# sound; the seventh makes it RUINS_STATE_ACTIVATED_ALL_DOTS and the statue activates ("something changed in the
# air", RUINS_STATE_ACTIVATED_STATUE 270). Out to Iron Island B3F. The statue's Registeel needs a fateful Regigigas
# (m6 Regi branches). The other two ruins' dot tables are unit-tested (m6-ops.test.ts).
party 0 platinum:SPECIES_GARCHOMP 60 platinum:MOVE_EARTHQUAKE
set flag platinum:FLAG_GAME_COMPLETED true
date 2009-03-22 12:00
warp platinum:MAP_HEADER_IRON_RUINS 7 11 up
until idle
+0 press up
until position 7 9 300
+0 release up
+0 press left
until position 5 9 300
+0 release left
until idle 300
+0 press up
until position 5 7 300
+0 release up
+0 press left
until position 4 7 300
+0 release left
until idle 300
+0 press up
until position 4 5 300
+0 release up
+0 press right
until position 5 5 300
+0 release right
until idle 300
+0 press down
until position 5 7 300
+0 release down
+0 press right
until position 7 7 300
+0 release right
until idle 300
+0 press up
until position 7 5 300
+0 release up
+0 press right
until position 9 5 300
+0 release right
until idle 300
+0 press down
until position 9 7 300
+0 release down
+0 press right
until position 10 7 300
+0 release right
until idle 300
+0 press down
until position 10 9 300
+0 release down
+0 press left
until position 9 9 300
+0 release left
advance text 3000
until idle 600
+0 assert var platinum:VAR_IRON_RUINS_STATE 270
+0 press down
until position 9 11 300
+0 release down
+0 press left
until position 7 11 300
+0 release left
+0 press down
until state player.zone "platinum:MAP_HEADER_IRON_ISLAND_B3F" 300
+0 release down
until idle 600
